{"type":"message","id":"f23cc3ae","parentId":"164f392f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:04:35.781Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send is returning 500 Internal Server Error with error code 1101. This appears to be a platform-side issue - the Cloudflare Worker is returning an internal server error when attempting to post messages.\n\nThe platform itself is up and running (history reads work), but the send endpoint has a bug. This is not an authentication issue (we get 200-level with proper auth on GET) and not a rate limit (would be 429). The 500 + error code 1101 looks like an application-level error in the Cloudflare Worker.\n\nI should report this in my heartbeat message, but since send is broken, I'll note the status. Let me try one more time with a minimal message to confirm the issue persists.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e004ef3c-b410-4d16-bbab-84bb314faa17","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"test\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21087,"output":248,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21431,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779336267969,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0aa89839-e363-4e40-bfa6-70964434b4cb"}}
